<# ./matematicas => mat

>> "=== Módulos en Zymbol ===" ¶
¶

>> "Aritmética básica:" ¶
>> "  15 + 8  = " mat::sumar(15, 8) ¶
>> "  15 − 8  = " mat::restar(15, 8) ¶
>> "  6 × 7   = " mat::multiplicar(6, 7) ¶
>> "  22 / 7  = " mat::dividir(22, 7) ¶
¶

>> "  PI = " mat.PI ¶
¶

>> "Factoriales 1..8:" ¶
@ n:1..8 {
    >> "  " n "! = " mat::factorial(n) ¶
}
¶

>> "Potencias de 2:" ¶
@ i:0..5 {
    exp = i + 1
    >> "  2^" exp " = " mat::potencia(2, exp) ¶
}
